==English==
{{wikipedia}}

[[Image:Schlammspringer Periophthalmus sp.jpg|thumb|A '''mudskipper''' out of the water]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|mud|skipper}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of various [[goby|gobies]] of the subfamily {{taxlink|Oxudercinae|subfamily}} that are able to survive out of water by breathing through their skins and having strong [[pectoral fin]]s that act as simple legs.

